{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"canvas-title","type":"text","text":"# Golden City Groups\n## City Groups · Bible Clubs · Classes · Collectives\n**Current stage:** Pre-launch church planting\n**Launch milestone:** September 20, 2026","x":-1900,"y":-990,"width":520,"height":190,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"status-legend","type":"text","text":"## Status Guide\n- 🟢 **Confirmed** — governing or approved context\n- 🟡 **Current work** — active pre-launch preparation\n- 🟣 **Approval required** — not governing yet\n- 🔵 **Planned / future** — a branch, not an active ministry","x":-1310,"y":-990,"width":620,"height":190},
		{"id":"canvas-use","type":"text","text":"## How to Read This Canvas\nMove left to right: **foundation → current pipeline → confirmed environments and planned offerings → readiness → future ideas**. A file or idea does not prove that a ministry is staffed, assigned, or launch-ready.","x":-620,"y":-990,"width":720,"height":190},
