		{"id":"foundation-rule","type":"text","text":"## Governing Rule\nMission, vision, values, theology, and confirmed decisions shape ministry practice. Planned structures remain provisional until their approval and readiness gates are complete.","x":-1840,"y":-50,"width":540,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"foundation-purpose","type":"text","text":"**Current model · Clarification to DEC-025**\n\nCity Groups — community, pastoral connection, and weekend-message application\n\nBible Clubs — Bible study\n\nClasses — equipping and disciple-maker development\n\nCollectives — gender-specific ministry\n\n*Recorded August 1, 2026; DEC-024's percentage shorthand is superseded.*","x":-1840,"y":150,"width":540,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"stage-gatherings","type":"text","text":"### 1. Church Plant Gatherings\nInterest Socials · Dinner Parties · Worship Nights · Service · Team Nights\n\n**Confirmed since March 2026**","x":-1110,"y":-640,"width":250,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"stage-launch-team","type":"text","text":"### 2. Launch Team\nMore than 50 committed volunteers preparing to become the church's initial ministry teams.\n\n**Confirmed**","x":-820,"y":-640,"width":250,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"stage-team-nights","type":"text","text":"### 3. Team Night Sign-ups\n**July 28 · August 11 · August 25**\nIn August, Paul supports Planning Center form submission, owns intake, and emails applicants to arrange interviews.\n\n**Approved · DEC-026**","x":-530,"y":-640,"width":220,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"stage-discernment","type":"text","text":"### 4. Leader Discernment\nPrayerfully identify and invite potential City Group leaders from within the Launch Team.\n\n**Planned · standards pending**","x":-1110,"y":-430,"width":250,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"stage-training","type":"text","text":"### 5. Leader Training\nTraining follows the three Team Nights and discernment.\n\n**Planned · dates and curriculum pending**","x":-820,"y":-430,"width":250,"height":160,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"stage-assignments","type":"text","text":"### 6. Group Assignments\nLeaders · hosts or locations · communities · capacity\n\n**Planned · none assigned here**","x":-530,"y":-430,"width":220,"height":160,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"stage-commissioning","type":"text","text":"### 7. Commissioning\nEntrust approved leaders after readiness review.\n\n**Planned · pastoral direction required**","x":-1010,"y":-230,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"stage-launch","type":"text","text":"### 8. Public Launch\n**September 20, 2026**\n\nConfirmed church launch; not the automatic start date for every Group or Class.","x":-690,"y":-230,"width":300,"height":150,"color":"4"},
