		{"id":"current-boundary","type":"text","text":"## Current Boundary\nInitial City Group leaders are identified and trained from the Launch Team—not recruited from the general public. Paul owns intake and initial follow-up, not final appointment. Interview standards, approval, training, assignment, safeguarding, appointment, and commissioning remain pending.","x":-1110,"y":200,"width":780,"height":190,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"current-planning-center","type":"file","file":"Groups Ministry/07 Operations/Planning Center Groups.md","x":-1110,"y":430,"width":780,"height":80,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"environment-model","type":"text","text":"## Golden City Groups — Four Environments\n**City Groups** · community + pastoral connection + Weekend Message Group Guide\n\n**Bible Clubs** · facilitator-led study of Scripture\n\n**Classes** · teacher-led equipping + disciple-maker development\n\n**Collectives** · gender-specific ministry\n\n*Current governing model · clarification to DEC-025*","x":-110,"y":-650,"width":700,"height":230,"color":"4"},
