		{"id":"collectives-open","type":"text","text":"### Collectives — confirmed fourth environment\nMen's Collective and Women's Collective are current expressions. Each still requires ownership and launch-readiness review.","x":-110,"y":-110,"width":700,"height":100,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"launch-public-extra","type":"text","text":"## Deferred Ideas\nRun Club · Youth City Group · Young Adults Group\n\n**Not required for the initial Groups & Classes launch.**","x":-110,"y":10,"width":700,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"launch-status","type":"text","text":"## Launch Status Rule\nA public listing confirms communication—not staffing, readiness, or ministry ownership. Every offering still needs an accountable leader, approved location or host, capacity, safeguarding, and a truthful participant next step.","x":-110,"y":130,"width":700,"height":150,"color":"5"},
