		{"id":"launch-fall-note","type":"text","text":"### Fall 2026 Ministry Window\nPublic sign-up goal: launch weekend and following weekend\n\nPlanned ministry window: early October through mid-December\n\nExact offering readiness still varies.","x":230,"y":320,"width":360,"height":180,"color":"3"},
