		{"id":"readiness-blockers","type":"text","text":"## Remaining Launch Blockers\n- Leader, host, and instructor standards\n- Active offering ownership and readiness\n- Training dates, assignments, and commissioning\n- Leaders, groups, hosts or locations, capacity\n- Planted curriculum and operational readiness\n- Safeguarding, escalation, and data governance\n- Planning Center permissions, enrollment ownership, and Church Center accuracy","x":820,"y":-180,"width":710,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"readiness-rule","type":"text","text":"## Readiness Rule\nNothing moves from **planned** to **launch-ready** until its pastoral, leadership, location, capacity, safeguarding, communication, and participant-path gates are complete.","x":820,"y":170,"width":710,"height":170,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"future-how-to","type":"text","text":"## How Future Ideas Branch\n1. Add the idea in this zone.\n2. Label it **Idea**, **Open Question**, or **Proposed**.\n3. Connect it to the ministry need it may serve.\n4. Move it left only after pastoral direction and a Decision Log entry.\n\nFuture space is valuable—but it must not masquerade as current ministry.","x":1760,"y":-640,"width":840,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"future-groups","type":"text","text":"## Future Group Expressions\n- Family-oriented home groups\n- Additional geographic communities\n- Affinity or seasonal groups\n- New expressions arising from real pastoral need and leader capacity\n\n**Ideas / unconfirmed**","x":1760,"y":-350,"width":260,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"future-classes","type":"text","text":"## Future Bible Clubs & Classes\n- Bible book or section studies\n- Biblical theology and formation\n- Covenant and temple\n- Ecclesiology\n- Leadership equipping\n\n**Ideas / unconfirmed**","x":2050,"y":-350,"width":260,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"future-leadership","type":"text","text":"## Future Leadership\n- Apprenticeship pathway\n- Broader public pathway\n- Coach or trainer layer when scale warrants\n- Multiplying leaders\n\n**Proposed / approval required**","x":2340,"y":-350,"width":260,"height":260,"color":"5"},
