		{"id":"future-rhythms","type":"text","text":"## Future Rhythms & Resources\nRetreats · specialized events · resource libraries · multiplication systems · advanced training · future semester programming\n\nBranch only as capacity and pastoral direction allow.","x":2050,"y":70,"width":550,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"future-prompts","type":"text","text":"## Questions That Should Generate Branches\n- What pastoral need are we seeing?\n- Who is this for?\n- How does it support Belonging, Beholding, and Becoming?\n- Who can faithfully lead it?\n- What must be approved?\n- Is this needed for launch, later, or never?","x":1760,"y":300,"width":840,"height":220},
